# Retched Wretch under Grafdigger's Cage: "return it to the battlefield under its owner's control and it loses all abilities".
# The Wretch card in the graveyard is a creature card, which the Cage keeps from entering (CR 101.2, 101.3), so it stays there
# and "it" - the permanent returned - does not exist to lose abilities. Blight Rot's four counters kill the 4/2 on turn 3 (it had
# -1/-1 counters, so the trigger is true). Mox Emerald pays the Cage, Mox Jet, Mox Pearl and Mox Ruby the Wretch, and Black
# Lotus Blight Rot as {B}{B}{B}.

